### ---------- Price range (cents) ----------

### 11. Between $20 and $30 (expect 6 items, total 6)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?minPrice=2000&maxPrice=3000

### 12. From $150 up (expect 2: Prada Women Bag, Marni Red & Black Suit)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?minPrice=15000

### 13. Up to $19.99, edge included (expect 3, all priced 1999)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?maxPrice=1999

### 14. maxPrice=0 must still filter (expect 0 items, total 0, not 30)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?maxPrice=0

### 15. Swapped range (expect 400: minPrice cannot be greater than maxPrice)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?minPrice=10000&maxPrice=2000

### 16. Negative price (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?minPrice=-5

### 17. Price with category (expect 2: Puma Future Rider Trainers, Nike Baseball Cleats)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?categoryId=5&maxPrice=10000